			<article id="post-0" class="post not-found">
				<header class="entry-header">
					<h1 class="entry-title">That page has moved or doesn't exist.</h1>
				</header><!-- .entry-header -->

				<div class="entry-content">
<h2>Change is Good, But it Sure Can Be Messy.</h2>
<p>Reusable Art has recently undergone the first major upgrade since I launched the site back in 2008. What you are looking for is still here, but the URL has most likely changed.</p>
<p>If you have come here via a link on another website, please let the other site owner know the URL has changed.</p>
<p>If you used a search engine, try duplicating your search phrase in our search box and hopefully you will find the image you were looking for.</p>

